| `debug`                     | `LogLevel.Debug`       |
| `info` **or** `information` | `LogLevel.Information` |
| `warn` **or** `warning`     | `LogLevel.Warning`     |
| `error`                     | `LogLevel.Error`       |
| `critical`                  | `LogLevel.Critical`    |
| `none`                      | `LogLevel.None`        |

> [!NOTE]
